# LabscriptAI OT

Use the bundled `opentrons-lab` MCP server and `skills/opentrons-*` skills for Opentrons protocol authoring, simulation, and safe runtime checks.

For new experiments, start with `opentrons-experiment-run`. Setup: [docs/GETTING_STARTED.md](../../docs/GETTING_STARTED.md).

Live robot actions are opt-in. Run simulation before unattended live execution. Treat vision as observation-only. Default order: dashboard → optional deck vision → optional liquid probe → execution. Honor explicit scoped software-check waivers per policy/safety-policy.md; the probe opt-in flag gates probe motion only.
